### Edge Cases Covered
✅ **Insufficient Balance**: Transfer rejected with error message
✅ **Self-Transfer**: Prevented with validation
✅ **Invalid Recipient**: Returns clear error if user not found
✅ **Concurrent Transfers**: Atomic operations prevent race conditions
✅ **Payment Failure**: Proper error handling and rollback
✅ **WebSocket Disconnect**: Auto-reconnection by Socket.io client
✅ **User Initialization**: Auto-creates user record with 100 coins on first API call

